    "detailed_description": "An unexpected opportunity, you come to an uninhabited island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe scenery here is beautiful and the resources are abundant, but there are no people here, only a group of red monsters. They have red skin and fiery tails.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut you can kill them with a gun. If you want to get an immersive monster combat experience, join us now!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMethods of Game Operations<br />\r\n<br />\r\nForward=W<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBack=S<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove Left=A<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove Right=D<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShooting=Left mouse button<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to use a gun to kill the monster<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease note, stay away from the monster<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter being touched by a monster, you will die<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComfortable and stress free<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou don't need to do tasks<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTraditional realism, Chinese style is fully displayed, with exquisite objects and realistic and exquisite scenes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe difficulty of the game is relatively high, which may require players to spend a lot of time familiarizing themselves with the operation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverall, on this mysterious island, you will face challenges and need to overcome them in order to kill all monsters",
    "about_the_game": "An unexpected opportunity, you come to an uninhabited island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe scenery here is beautiful and the resources are abundant, but there are no people here, only a group of red monsters. They have red skin and fiery tails.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut you can kill them with a gun. If you want to get an immersive monster combat experience, join us now!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMethods of Game Operations<br />\r\n<br />\r\nForward=W<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBack=S<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove Left=A<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove Right=D<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShooting=Left mouse button<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to use a gun to kill the monster<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease note, stay away from the monster<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter being touched by a monster, you will die<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComfortable and stress free<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou don't need to do tasks<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTraditional realism, Chinese style is fully displayed, with exquisite objects and realistic and exquisite scenes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe difficulty of the game is relatively high, which may require players to spend a lot of time familiarizing themselves with the operation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverall, on this mysterious island, you will face challenges and need to overcome them in order to kill all monsters",
